- `CARGO_TARGET_DIR=/tmp/jansu-ts-storage cargo test -p jansu-storage --test log_contract --no-default-features --features dynostore,libsql,slatedb -- --nocapture` - 8/8 passed
- `CARGO_TARGET_DIR=/tmp/jansu-ts-broker cargo test -p jansu-broker --test list_offsets --no-default-features --features dynostore,libsql,slatedb -- --nocapture` - 21/21 passed

### Outcome

- The Phase 08 timestamp after-last case is now proven for dynostore, libsql, and slatedb, and the broker proof now checks both the offset and timestamp returned at end-of-log.

### Residual Risks

- Remaining Phase 08 work is back to the other open buckets: truncation/recovery, transactional read_committed visibility, incremental fetch sessions, topic IDs, broader Fetch max-byte parity, and the remaining audit/caps backlog.
